---
// No Layout wrapper — this page is designed for print only
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>FLIP: Futures Literacies in Praxis · Quest Labs</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;1,400&family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    :root {
      --violet: #6B3FA0;
      --violet-mid: #8B5CC8;
      --lavender: #C4A8E8;
      --cream: #FDFCFA;
      --ink: #1A1028;
      --ink-mid: #3D2D58;
      --ink-dim: #6B5E85;
      --border: rgba(107, 63, 160, 0.2);
    }

    html, body {
      background: var(--cream);
      color: var(--ink);
      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
      font-size: 10pt;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    /* ── PRINT BUTTON (screen only) ── */
    .print-bar {
      background: var(--violet);
      color: white;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 0.6rem 1rem;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }
    .print-bar button {
      background: white;
      color: var(--violet);
      border: none;
      padding: 0.35rem 1rem;
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      cursor: pointer;
      border-radius: 2px;
    }

    /* ── PAGE ── */
    .page {
      width: 8.5in;
      min-height: 11in;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0.55in 0.6in 0.5in;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0;
    }

    /* ── HEADER ── */
    .header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-start;
      padding-bottom: 0.3in;
      border-bottom: 1.5pt solid var(--violet);
      margin-bottom: 0.22in;
    }
    .header-left {}
    .eyebrow {
      font-size: 7pt;
      letter-spacing: 0.22em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--ink-dim);
      margin-bottom: 0.1in;
    }
    .program-title {
      font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
      font-size: 28pt;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--ink);
      line-height: 1;
      margin-bottom: 0.04in;
    }
    .program-subtitle {
      font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
      font-size: 11pt;
      font-style: italic;
      color: var(--ink-dim);
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    }
    .header-right {
      text-align: right;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-end;
      gap: 0.06in;
    }
    .header-name {
      font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
      font-size: 13pt;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--ink);
    }
    .header-title {
      font-size: 7.5pt;
      color: var(--ink-dim);
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    }
    .header-contact {
      font-size: 7pt;
      color: var(--violet);
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    }

    /* ── LEDE ── */
    .lede {
      margin-bottom: 0.18in;
    }
    .lede-headline {
      font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
      font-size: 15pt;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--ink);
      margin-bottom: 0.06in;
      line-height: 1.25;
    }
    .lede-body {
      font-size: 9.5pt;
      color: var(--ink-mid);
      line-height: 1.6;
      max-width: 6.5in;
    }

    /* ── TWO COLUMN BODY ── */
    .body-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 0.22in;
      margin-bottom: 0.18in;
    }

    .section-label {
      font-size: 6.5pt;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.22em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--violet);
      margin-bottom: 0.07in;
      padding-bottom: 0.04in;
      border-bottom: 0.5pt solid var(--border);
    }

    ul.outcomes {
      list-style: none;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.055in;
    }
    ul.outcomes li {
      font-size: 9pt;
      color: var(--ink-mid);
      line-height: 1.5;
      padding-left: 0.12in;
      position: relative;
    }
    ul.outcomes li::before {
      content: '◎';
      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
      color: var(--lavender);
      font-size: 7pt;
      top: 2pt;
    }

    .credentials-list {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.055in;
    }
    .credential {
      font-size: 9pt;
      color: var(--ink-mid);
      line-height: 1.45;
      padding-left: 0.12in;
      position: relative;
    }
    .credential::before {
      content: '–';
      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
      color: var(--ink-dim);
    }
    .credential strong {
      color: var(--ink);
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    /* ── LOGISTICS + PRICING STRIP ── */
    .bottom-strip {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 0.22in;
      margin-bottom: 0.18in;
    }

    .logistics-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 0.04in 0.12in;
    }
    .log-item {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.02in;
    }
    .log-label {
      font-size: 6.5pt;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.14em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--ink-dim);
    }
    .log-value {
      font-size: 9pt;
      color: var(--ink-mid);
      line-height: 1.4;
    }

    .pricing-block p {
      font-size: 9pt;
      color: var(--ink-mid);
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin-bottom: 0.06in;
    }
    .pricing-block p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
    .equity-statement {
      font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
      font-size: 10pt;
      font-style: italic;
      color: var(--violet);
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    /* ── FOOTER ── */
    .footer {
      border-top: 0.5pt solid var(--border);
      padding-top: 0.1in;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      margin-top: auto;
    }
    .footer-left {
      font-size: 7.5pt;
      color: var(--ink-dim);
    }
    .footer-left strong {
      color: var(--ink);
      font-weight: 500;
    }
    .footer-right {
      font-size: 7.5pt;
      color: var(--violet);
      text-align: right;
    }

    /* ── PRINT ── */
    @media print {
      .print-bar { display: none; }
      html, body { background: white; }
      .page {
        width: 100%;
        min-height: auto;
        padding: 0.45in 0.5in;
      }
      a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
    }

    @page {
      size: letter;
      margin: 0;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="print-bar">
  <span>This page is designed to print as a one-page PDF</span>
  <button onclick="window.print()">Print / Save as PDF</button>
</div>

<div class="page">

  <!-- HEADER -->
  <div class="header">
    <div class="header-left">
      <p class="eyebrow">Quest Labs · Educators · Fall 2026</p>
      <h1 class="program-title">Quest Labs</h1>
      <p class="program-subtitle">Futures Literacy for Schools &amp; Districts</p>
      <p class="program-subtitle" style="font-size:9pt;margin-top:0.04in;color:var(--violet)">Strategic foresight anchored in healing-centered practice.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="header-right">
      <span class="header-name">Makēda Gershenson</span>
      <span class="header-title">Founder, Quest Labs · Practitioner-Researcher</span>
      <span class="header-title">MEd, Stanford · MA Futures Research 2027, Freie Universität Berlin · EMBA</span>
      <span class="header-contact">questlabs.world/educators · questlabs.world@proton.me</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- LEDE -->
  <div class="lede">
    <h2 class="lede-headline">The world your students are entering doesn't exist yet. Most professional development doesn't help educators meet it.<br>Quest Labs does, in three formats shaped around the team you lead.</h2>
    <p class="lede-body">Futures literacy gives educators the tools to read what's coming. Not to predict it, but to navigate it with their students, with confidence and care. Designed with and for Black and Latino educators and the leaders holding schools together.</p>
  </div>

  <!-- THREE OFFERINGS + CREDENTIALS -->
  <div class="body-grid">
    <div>
      <p class="section-label">Three ways to engage</p>
      <ul class="outcomes">
        <li><strong>90-minute remote session.</strong> Fit for a staff PD day, induction, or site leadership convening. Participants land one competency from the Futures Alphabet and leave with a tool and shared language.</li>
        <li><strong>Multi-session series.</strong> 3 to 6 sessions shaped around what your district is working toward: equity goals, site accountability milestones, leader retention. The series takes the shape of your question.</li>
        <li><strong>FLIP leadership cohort.</strong> 12 weeks of enhanced professional development for a leadership team or principal cadre. Built for the leadership demands of districts serving predominantly Black and Latino students.</li>
      </ul>
      <p style="font-size:8.5pt;color:var(--ink-dim);font-style:italic;line-height:1.5;margin-top:0.08in">The series and FLIP cohort include analog and offline tools and dyad practices: low-stakes, high-insights practices that keep the learning living between sessions.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="section-label">What this is grounded in</p>
      <div class="credentials-list">
        <p class="credential"><strong>Staff Developer, Morningside Center for Teaching Social Responsibility</strong>, NYC (2016 to present). Trains NYC DOE teachers in restorative approaches. <strong>One partner site: 80% decrease in Level 4 and 5 incidents, 66.7% decrease in suspensions following implementation.</strong></p>
        <p class="credential"><strong>14 years of remote PD and training delivery</strong> (2012 to present), across public schools, higher ed, youth development, and nonprofit teacher training.</p>
        <p class="credential"><strong>5 years K-5 classroom teaching</strong>, Ohlone Elementary, Palo Alto Unified.</p>
        <p class="credential"><strong>Academic Life Coach</strong>, 76 verified testimonials on Coach.me. <strong>Certified Mindfulness Teacher</strong> (IBME). <strong>Six Seconds EQ Educator, Practitioner, and Assessor</strong>.</p>
        <p class="credential">Research developed from <strong>545 educator contributions, 170+ participants</strong> across two international gatherings.</p>
        <p class="credential"><strong>Speaker:</strong> Healing-Centered Education Conference (3x) · Thrive Conference (2x) · Futures4Europe (Rome) · UNESCO Special Session, Anticipation Conference (Milan).</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- LOGISTICS + PRICING -->
  <div class="bottom-strip">
    <div>
      <p class="section-label">The logistics</p>
      <div class="logistics-grid">
        <div class="log-item">
          <span class="log-label">Format</span>
          <span class="log-value">Virtual, via Zoom</span>
        </div>
        <div class="log-item">
          <span class="log-label">Start</span>
          <span class="log-value">Fall 2026, now forming</span>
        </div>
        <div class="log-item" style="grid-column: span 2">
          <span class="log-label">Leadership cohort</span>
          <span class="log-value">Bring your team. Limited school-wide and district slots available.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="section-label">Pricing</p>
      <div class="pricing-block">
        <p class="equity-statement">This work should reach every school, not only well-resourced ones.</p>
        <p>Tiered pricing for individual seats, leadership cohorts, series, and school-wide engagements. Contact to find the fit.</p>
        <p style="font-weight:500;color:var(--ink)">questlabs.world@proton.me</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- CLOSING -->
  <div style="text-align:center;padding:0.1in 0 0.08in;border-top:0.5pt solid var(--border);margin-bottom:0.08in">
    <p style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:italic;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.5">
      No one-size-fits-all. You know your school, your community, your educators. We'll build the shape of the work from there.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- FOOTER -->
  <div class="footer">
    <div class="footer-left">
      <strong>Quest Labs</strong> · A Living Lab for Futures Literacies · Berlin &amp; Beyond · Est. 2022
    </div>
    <div class="footer-right">
      questlabs.world/educators
    </div>
  </div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
